; ---- WALL-JUMP TEST CHANNEL (Step 3) -------------------------------------
; Two tall walls facing each other with a narrow gap between them. Jump into one
; wall, then press jump to leap off it toward the other, and repeat to climb the
; gap. If the cat just slides down instead of kicking off, wall-jump isn't
; unlocked (GameState.has_wall_jump) — see the debug toggle.
