text = "TEST ROOM — Steps 2 & 3
Move: A/D or Arrow keys
Jump: Space or W  (hold for higher, tap for a hop)
Wall-jump: jump into the left walls, press jump to kick off, zig-zag up
Dash: Left Shift  (bursts in your facing / held direction)

All abilities are on while GameState.debug_unlock_everything = true."
